	<text xml:lang="la">
		<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" subtype="metadata" n="1">Die ungefähre Datierung ergibt sich aus der inhaltlichen Anknüpfung an den vorausgegangenen Brief (s. unten Z. 1 mit Anm. 2).</note>
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">De curanda valetudine quae nuper hortatus sum te<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Vgl. oben <ref target="file11466">Nr. 1423</ref>, 1-12.</note>, mi <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, eis id <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>addo, quod animadvertens ex amicorum relatione te victu semper uti communi maxime <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>et eo, quo utitur tota familia, iudico te non posse valere recte, nisi diętę <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>rationem instituas meliorem.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Caloris vis<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>in der Vorlage (wohl irrtümlich)</hi> vix.</note> maxima ac praestantissima continuatione ac per<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>petuitate cogitacionum dissipatur; itaque debilitato calore et virtute naturali crassum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>alimentum natura non solvit; non ęgre complectitur, sed in eo conficiendo superandoque <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>valde laborat.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Itaque qui victus<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>in der Vorlage irrtümlich</hi> victus esse.</note> subsidium imbecillę naturę debet esse, is, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>cum crassus est, etiam impedimentum est.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Itaque destitui et labefieri hoc pacto <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>optimam etiam constitutionem necesse est.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Vide, mi <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, hęc evidentissima <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>sunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Itaque edes praeter pulliculos et aviculas in hac imbecillitate nihil, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>de carnibus dico, unctum et pingue, crassum et nervosum, tenax et glutino<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>sum nihil.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Pestis est casęus crassus et tenax et certa materia vertiginis.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Nisi <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>te ipsum sperem vel usu deprehendisse, ostenderem tibi, cum virtus laborat, caseum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>tenacem semper gignere vertiginem.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Obsecro ideo te, quae causa est, cur <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>vereare, quam genere vitę distas et differs, tam dieta et victu discre<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>pare ab aliis.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">At vita est studiosi maxime hominis et corpus labore <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>et<pb type="edition" next="171"/> exercitatione destitutum affligens, sit igitur et accomodata diętę ratio.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Crede mihi, non est pietas hęc contemnere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in domino Christo<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>der Vorlage</hi> X Ptn.</note>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p1365">Grynęus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Domino <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">Henricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>fratri et <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>amico colendissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
